---
// src/pages/industries/hosting-cloud-providers.astro
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Infrastructure Sourcing for Hosting & Cloud Providers | InfraHub"
  description="Source wholesale bare metal fleets, refurbished enterprise hardware, carrier-neutral colocation, and high-capacity optical transport for hosting and IaaS platforms."
  canonicalPath="/industries/hosting-cloud-providers"
>
  <div class="section section-hero network-overlay">
    <div class="container industry-container">
      <div class="industry-header">
        <span class="industry-kicker">INDUSTRY SOURCING FRAMEWORK</span>
        <h1>Hosting & Cloud Providers</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Scale your hosting or cloud platform profitably. Sourcing wholesale bare-metal compute, enterprise server hardware, high-density colocation space, and carrier-neutral cross connects.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="industry-stack-grid">
        <div class="stack-card">
          <span class="stack-pill">Compute Fleet</span>
          <h2>Wholesale Bare Metal & IaaS</h2>
          <p>Deploy unbranded dedicated bare metal clusters in Europe, Asia, and North America with customized storage, high-memory configurations, and unmetered network ports.</p>
          <a href="/offers" class="stack-link">View Current Bare Metal Offers →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="stack-card">
          <span class="stack-pill">CapEx Hardware</span>
          <h2>Enterprise Refurbished Servers</h2>
          <p>Source enterprise dual-socket server platforms, new or refurbished. Condition, warranty, testing and pricing are confirmed against the specific supplier quotation.</p>
          <a href="/lets-talk?service=hardware" class="stack-link">Request current server availability →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="stack-card">
          <span class="stack-pill">Physical Footprint</span>
          <h2>Colocation Space & Power</h2>
          <p>Cabinets and private cages in carrier-neutral facilities. Rack size, power density, redundancy and cross-connect costs are confirmed per facility.</p>
          <a href="/colocation" class="stack-link">Explore Colocation Sourcing →</a>
        </div>

        <div class="stack-card">
          <span class="stack-pill">Transport</span>
          <h2>Optical Interconnect (DCI)</h2>
          <p>Link datacenter locations with lit wavelengths or dark fiber. Where physical diversity matters, route evidence should be checked with the provider.</p>
          <a href="/wavelengths" class="stack-link">Explore Optical DCI →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="industry-cta-box">
        <h2>Source Infrastructure for Your Hosting Platform</h2>
        <a href="/lets-talk?industry=hosting" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">Request Wholesale Sourcing Review</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .industry-container { max-width: 1040px; }
  .industry-header { text-align: left; max-width: 860px; margin: 0 0 54px; padding-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
  .industry-kicker { font-size: 0.74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--accent-blue); display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .industry-header h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); font-weight: 700; margin: 16px 0; }
  .industry-header .lead { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }
  .industry-stack-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; margin-bottom: 60px; }
  @media (min-width: 640px) { .industry-stack-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  .stack-card { background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 32px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
  .stack-pill { font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent-teal); letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .stack-card h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .stack-card p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .stack-link { font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-blue); }
  .stack-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .industry-cta-box { background-color: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: 44px 36px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; text-align: left; gap: 16px; }
</style>
